  "messages": [
    {
      "conversation_id": "conv_1791357100787_em0x2",
      "sender": "user",
      "message": "Halo Inpartner, apa saja layanan konsultasi yang tersedia?",
      "id": "msg_1791357100791_akusb",
      "created_at": "2026-10-07T07:11:40.791Z"
    },
    {
      "conversation_id": "conv_1791357100787_em0x2",
      "sender": "bot",
      "message": "Halo! Saya adalah **Inpartner AI Assistant**, asisten konsultasi bisnis resmi dari **PT Inpartner Optima Integra (INPARTNER)**.\n\nSaya dapat membantu menganalisis kebutuhan perusahaan Anda dan memberikan rekomendasi solusi melalui **5 Layanan Resmi INPARTNER**:\n1. 🏢 **Strategy & Corporate Advisory:** Perumusan strategi korporat, transformasi bisnis, advisory M&A, persiapan IPO, dan restrukturisasi perusahaan.\n2. 💰 **Investment & Project Advisory:** Studi kelayakan (Feasibility Studies), analisis komersial & finansial, valuasi independen, dan pengembangan proyek investasi.\n3. 📈 **Market Access & Business Expansion:** Riset pasar, strategi Go-To-Market (GTM), identifikasi distributor, dan fasilitasi business matching.\n4. 🌏 **Cross-Border & Technology Advisory:** Kemitraan strategis internasional, Joint Venture (JV), dan transfer teknologi lintas negara.\n5. 👥 **Human Capital & Organization:** Executive search (C-level & senior leadership), desain organisasi, dan program pengembangan eksekutif (*The Executive Business Program*).\n\nSilakan ceritakan rencana bisnis atau kendala yang sedang dihadapi perusahaan Anda, dan saya siap membantu!",
      "intent": "service_information",
      "metadata": {
        "sources": [
          "INPARTNER Official Advisory Services",
          "Advisory Handoff Protocol",
          "INPARTNER 5-Stage Advisory Methodology"
        ],
        "suggest_lead_capture": false,
        "quick_actions": [
