    {
      "conversation_id": "conv_1791359547010_0q50g",
      "sender": "bot",
      "message": "Berdasarkan dokumentasi resmi layanan konsultasi Inpartner mengenai **3. Market Access & Business Expansion**:\n\n## 3. Market Access & Business Expansion\nEnabling international companies (notably South Korean investors) and regional businesses to enter, capture, and dominate the Indonesian market.\n\n### Key Advisory Practices:\n- **Market Research & Business Intelligence:** Granular TAM/SAM/SOM market sizing, regulatory entry barriers, consumer demand patterns, and competitive benchmarking.\n- **Go-To-Market (GTM) Strategy:** Distribution architecture, pricing...\n\nInpartner mendampingi klien korporasi dengan pendekatan holistik menyelaraskan strategi bisnis, proses operasional, kapabilitas SDM, dan teknologi.\n\nUntuk pembahasan yang disesuaikan dengan prioritas bisnis perusahaan Anda, silakan ajukan konsultasi melalui formulir di bawah ini atau terhubung langsung via WhatsApp di **[+62 859 3454 8202](https://wa.me/6285934548202)**. Tim Business Development kami akan segera menghubungi Anda untuk koordinasi lebih lanjut.",
